From: VisualSubForge contributors
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter/gfxcapture: include the header declaring std::system_error

The exception handler uses std::system_error. libc++ does not guarantee that
the other C++ headers include <system_error> transitively. FFmpeg 8.1.2 fails
to compile this file with the selected MSYS2 CLANG64 toolchain without it.

SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
--- a/libavfilter/vsrc_gfxcapture_winrt.cpp
+++ b/libavfilter/vsrc_gfxcapture_winrt.cpp
@@ -54,6 +54,7 @@
 #include <mutex>
 #include <regex>
 #include <string>
+#include <system_error>
 #include <thread>
 #include <type_traits>
 
